  "acceptance": [
    "Actual Kustomize staging/production outputs match constrained source objects, pass strict pinned schemas with no skips and reject real unknown-field/type violations. Root k8s:validate is implemented and actually run, and infra:check invokes it in existing core CI.",
    "API1/Recreate, process live/ready split,20s grace around existing12s drain, private ClusterIP services, no root/tokens/privilege/writable root/host networking, bounded writable paths and peak web-surge/migration accounting enforced by policy and unsafe mutation regressions.",
    "No Namespace/SA/config/Secret/DB/PVC/RBAC resource is under application prune ownership. Required references and environment namespaces/data peers are enumerated; manifests remain inert until independent credentials/policy/artifact/full-sync/target qualifications.",
    "Disposable local1.37.2 API-server schema/admission and explicit-context node/ingress metadata were actually observed. No app workloads were applied; credential/registry/ingress/CNI readiness is explicitly not inferred. Actual target availability is a separate N04-04 gate.",
    "Tool/archive/schema checksums and official/immutable source constraints enforced; corrupt downloads/cache fail before execution. No default kubeconfig or real Secret/ConfigMap values accessed. Exact owned fixture cleanup verified, original runtime/DB/dependency/old evidence and release gates preserved."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No active application image release/digest binding; reserved registry.invalid sentinels are intentionally not deployable. Promotion/full sync/actual staging are N04-02/N04-03/N04-04.",
    "No real cluster/server, external namespace/DB/PVC/configuration/SA/registry/session/encryption secrets or target resource/storage/backup inputs qualified. Secret/ConfigMap values were not read.",
    "Ingress class absence was observed in the owned fixture; no TLS/WSS/Origin/CSRF/private-route qualification or CNI traffic enforcement test. Source rules alone do not prove enforcement.",
    "Local API-server admission applies no application workloads and cannot prove boot, readiness semantics, registry authentication, migrations, Argo sync/prune/drain or rollback.",
    "Node image/validation tools/schemas are pinned for stated scope. k3d packaged helper images and host/runtime/kernel are not a complete hermetic/signed/CVE-qualified stack. Control-plane memory limit is not a total fixture/server or capacity budget.",
    "No fresh browser/integration/application image build is claimed for N04-01; application/package/dependency/SQL source is preserved from f97c1b4 and its separately recorded N05-06 checks.",
    "Known prior hosted/enforcement findings are not resolved or freshly re-observed here. Publishing/automatic promotion remain disabled, release NOT_REQUESTED, mobile contexts undistributed, N13/N14 inactive. Private raw artifacts remain local until owner cleanup, not off-host archived."
  ],
